1
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,300
My name is Victor.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:04,900
Hi.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,620
And you are...

4
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:10,700
You're Franck.

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,820
Oh, you're so much more than just a sheep,
aren't you?

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,340
Yeah?

7
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,380
How would you know?

8
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,790
Look at you.
You're an adventurer, Franck.

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,940
Just like me.

10
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,780
You're a lone wolf.

11
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,880
Tell me, does one choose to be alone?

12
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,190
No, one doesn't.

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,080
One doesn't even choose to be a wolf.

14
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:42,690
Or does one?

15
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:50,630
Well, Mr. Hector...

16
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:51,770
Victor. Victor.

17
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,460
I don't know what you're on about,

18
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:57,290
but I'm just a sheep
minding its own business.

19
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:00,760
And I suggest you do the same.

20
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:03,540
No, no, no, no! Franck!
Wait, wait, wait!

21
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:05,220
No. This is not...

22
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:06,470
...the way.

23
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:09,400
Just give me one minute
of your precious time.

24
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,250
Precious time.

25
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:15,670
Yeah, just give me one minute.

26
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:18,230
You would have one more minute,
wouldn't you?
